OL,3,GNEWSABristol Airport hit by air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights have been cancelled and delayed
OL,7,Fat Bristol Airport amid UK-wide
OL,8,Ftechnical issues affecting air traffic
OL,9,Fcontrol.
OL,11,FStranded passengers have complained on
OL,12,Flong delays, with the airport's live
OL,13,Fdepartures page showing dozens of
OL,14,Fflights either cancelled or with
OL,15,F"estimated" departure times far later
OL,16,Fthan originally scheduled.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
