OL,3,GNEWSABristol Airport hit by air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FAir traffic control group Nats said
OL,7,Fearlier a "technical issue" was
OL,8,Faffecting flights departing the UK. A
OL,9,Ffix was underway they later added, but
OL,10,Fthe problem has caused extensive
OL,11,Fdisruption to flight schedules.
OL,13,FBristol Airport has advised passengers
OL,14,Fto check their flight information with
OL,15,Ftheir airline before heading to the
OL,16,Fairport.
